Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:38.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（劳伦斯 堪萨斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.00,0:04:52.30,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.54,0:00:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}邪恶力量前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on Supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你弟弟说晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say good night to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.06,0:00:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.45,0:00:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.20,0:00:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好梦 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.94,0:00:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.70,0:00:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你来帮我找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}找寻爸爸的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trail for Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.11,0:00:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一天比一天渺茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's getting colder every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为我不像你那么想找到爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wanna find Dad as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.32,0:00:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈死了 她再也回不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom's gone, and she isn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不许你这么说她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk about her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.47,0:00:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 甜心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.49,0:01:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不去睡觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why aren't you in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:03.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的衣柜里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something in my closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.74,0:01:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看 什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? There's nothing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.96,0:01:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.15,0:01:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 睡觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on. Into bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.12,0:01:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不喜欢这栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.19,0:01:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你只是现在还没习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just not used to it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.64,0:01:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你和你弟弟还有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and your brother and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.09,0:01:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们住在这会很幸福的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are going to be very happy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:01:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.19,0:02:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.19,0:02:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.27,0:02:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.14,0:02:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为了安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.96,0:02:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 千万别是老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, God, don't let it be rats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.06,0:03:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.76,0:05:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 我在浏览一些网站\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I've been cruising some websites.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.52,0:05:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想找到侯选的下一站目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I found a few candidates for our next gig.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在卡利海岸找到了一首捕鱼船\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fishing trawler found off the coast of Cali, its crew vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.06,0:05:29.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它的船员都消失了 在西边的船仓里发现有破坏的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we've got some cattle mutilations in West Texas.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.27,0:05:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 我说这些猎鬼的事很无聊吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Am I boring you with this hunting-evil stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.45,0:05:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我在听\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.59,0:05:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.42,0:05:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个萨克啦曼多人用枪射击自己头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here, a Sacramento man shot himself in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.66,0:05:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}三次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.50,0:05:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对这些没一点想法 兄弟？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any of these things blowing up your skirt, pal?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.43,0:05:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我以前见过这个 - 见过什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, l've seen this. - Seen what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.79,0:06:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我知道下一站去哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I know where we have to go next.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.68,0:06:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.90,0:06:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.40,0:06:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回堪萨斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back to Kansas.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 随你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, random.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么那么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这张照片是在我们家门前拍的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, this photo was taken in front of our old house, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.18,0:06:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 妈妈死的那所房子？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The house where Mom died? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.00,0:06:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它被火烧塌了 可没完全毁了 他们重建了它 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't burn down, not completely. They rebuilt it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.81,0:06:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.86,0:06:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你究竟想说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.17,0:06:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 这也许听起来很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, look. This is gonna sound crazy…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.25,0:06:38.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但现在住在我们老房子里的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the people who live in our old house…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.60,0:06:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得他们处境危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}l think they might be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么那么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.16,0:06:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 你得相信我 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}st Look, just You gotta trust me on this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, whoa, whoa. Trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 那不行 你得给我个其它的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You gotta give me a little more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我真的不能解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can't really explain it is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.57,0:06:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.56,0:06:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不说理由 我哪也不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere until you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会做噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have these nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时它们会实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes they come true.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}又是那个梦？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come again?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在杰西卡死前很多天前我就梦到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}l dreamt about Jessica's death for days before it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.30,0:07:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正常人都会做奇怪的梦 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, people have weird dreams, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.81,0:07:25.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得那是巧合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it's just a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.84,0:07:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我梦到血滴下来 她在天花板上 那火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I dreamt about the blood, her on the ceiling, the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我不相信 所以我什么都没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do anything because I didn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.86,0:07:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我梦到了那棵树 我们的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm dreaming about that tree, our house…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面尖叫着救命的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and about some woman screaming for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这又开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where it all started, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一定意味着什么 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has to mean something, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么意思啊 迪恩？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean, you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.61,0:07:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这个女人可能处境很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}This woman might be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许就是这个怪物杀了妈妈和杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This might be the thing that killed Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.47,0:07:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打住 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Just slow down, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}首先你说 你得到暗示\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, first you tell me you've got the Shining…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.53,0:08:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后你就要我和你一起回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you tell me that I've gotta go back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特别是当我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially when…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.97,0:08:09.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当我发誓再也不回那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I swore to myself that I would never go back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.10,0:08:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我们必须要查清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…Dean, we have to check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去确认这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.48,0:08:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 我们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.74,0:08:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吧 伙计？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna be all right, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:08:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我跟着你进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me get back to you on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.15,0:09:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉打搅到你 女士 我们是政府…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to bother you, madam. We're with the.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是 萨姆·温彻斯特 这是我哥迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm Sam Winchester. And this is my brother, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.17,0:09:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们以前住这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.01,0:09:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们刚好路过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we were just driving by…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.09,0:09:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们想是否能看看这老房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we were wondering if we could come see the old place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.21,0:09:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这太有趣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.71,0:09:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's so funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.35,0:09:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我刚好找到些你们的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I think I found some of your photos the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.00,0:09:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果汁 果汁 果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juice. Juice. Juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是里奇 他就喜欢喝果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Richie. He's kind of a juice junkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.53,0:09:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但他其实挺懂礼貌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, hey, at least he won't get scurvy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.98,0:10:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎丽 这是 萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sari, this is Sam and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:05.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们以前住在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They used to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.18,0:10:07.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 嗨 - 嗨 莎丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hey, Sari.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.88,0:10:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你刚搬进来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you just moved in?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 从威其塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. From Wichita.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在这有亲戚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got family here, or…?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.58,0:10:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我只是 需要一个新的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I just…needed a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.94,0:10:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.40,0:10:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以新镇子 新工作 我找到这新房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}new town, new job I mean, as soon as I find one. New house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这里怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how you liking it so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很尊重你们童年的这栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, all due respect to your childhood home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.94,0:10:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们一定在这里度过了不少快乐时光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, l'm sure you have lots of happy memories here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.06,0:10:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这房子有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this place has its issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.17,0:10:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它有点老了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's just getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如房子里的配线 你也清楚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like the wiring, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.74,0:10:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我这里灯常常一闪闪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got flickering lights almost hourly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦 这可不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.49,0:10:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.98,0:10:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}水槽常堵死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sink's backed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.03,0:11:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}地下室还有老鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's rats in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.34,0:11:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:06.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是想抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mean to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.28,0:11:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 你是见到了老鼠 还是只听到刮刻的声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.Have you seen the rats or have you just heard scratching?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.62,0:11:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上只是声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the scratching, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.06,0:11:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}问问他们 他们在这住的时候 它就在这里了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask them if it was here when they lived here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:24.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 莎丽？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, Sari?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.10,0:11:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我衣柜里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing in my closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 宝贝 衣柜里什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, baby. There was nothing in their closets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.47,0:11:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对的 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.05,0:11:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 当然什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.06,0:11:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}几天前的夜里她做过噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had a nightmare the other night.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.13,0:11:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是做梦 它走到了我的卧室里 身上是火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}l wasn't dreaming. It came into my bedroom, and it was on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 一个全身带火的影像 - 詹妮是你梦里的那个女人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You hear that? A figure on fire. - That was the woman in your dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.56,0:11:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 你也听到她说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.She was talking about scratching.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.37,0:11:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}刮刻的声音 闪烁的灯光？\N{\fnArial\fs30}flickering lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都是恶鬼存在的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both signs of a malevolent spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我才意识到你的奇怪的梦正在实现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just freaked out your weirdo visions are coming true.Forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那屋子里的东西 你不觉得就是它杀了妈妈和杰西卡？\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a minute. The thing in the house, think it killed Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.51,0:12:02.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.06,0:12:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它是回来了还是它一直都在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has it come back? Has it been there the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许完全是其它的东西呢 我们一点也不清楚 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or it's something else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:08.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些人很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, those people are in danger, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.96,0:12:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得帮他们离开那房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.18,0:12:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们以后会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.91,0:12:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我是说现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.97,0:12:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那怎么做？她会相信你的故事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you gonna do that? Got a story she'll believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我们该怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.02,0:12:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们必须得冷静 必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta chill out, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果是其它的情况下 我们会怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this was any other kind ofjob, what would we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.05,0:12:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得查清楚我们面对的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd try to figure out what we were dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要研究这房子的历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd dig into the history of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.77,0:12:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 除了我们知道的东西外的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except we already know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.51,0:12:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我们知道多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but how much do we know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.61,0:12:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much do you actually remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.31,0:12:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是说哪天晚上吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}About that night, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.54,0:12:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 记得不是太多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我记得那火焰 热浪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember the fire. The heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.74,0:12:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我抱着你从前门逃出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I carried you out the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.03,0:12:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 你不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Why, you never knew that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.98,0:13:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和我一样也知道爸爸的事 妈妈她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, well, you know Dad's story as well as I do. Mom was…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就在天花板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was on the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.09,0:13:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸发现她的时候 那个把她钉在那的东西早走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever put her there was long gone by the time Dad found her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他一点也不知道那究竟是怎么回事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he never had a theory about what did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.49,0:13:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他知道 那就是他不愿意透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he did, he kept it to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.02,0:13:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老天也知道我问了他多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows we asked him enough times.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.25,0:13:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.31,0:13:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们要弄清楚现在是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if we're gonna figure out what's going on now…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.79,0:13:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得查出原来的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have to figure out what happened back then…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看看它是不是同一个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and see if it's the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.63,0:13:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.37,0:13:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和爸的朋友邻居 住在这的人都谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to Dad's friends, neighbors. People who were there at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.47,0:13:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这对你又是个难题吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this feel like just another job to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.49,0:13:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我马上回来 我去下厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back. I gotta go the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是约翰·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is John Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.34,0:14:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果情况紧急 请打给我的儿子迪恩 866- 907- 3235\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is an emergency, call my son, Dean. 866-907-3235.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以前留过信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}l know l've left you messages before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.15,0:14:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你收到了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know if you get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我现在和萨姆一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But l'm with Sam…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.05,0:14:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在劳伦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're in Lawrence…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.67,0:14:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们家的老房子里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's something in our old house.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.32,0:14:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不清楚那是不是杀害妈妈的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if it's the thing that killed Mom or not…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.59,0:14:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}but…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.62,0:14:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论你现在在做什么 如果你能来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever you're doing, if you could get here…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.62,0:15:05.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}求你了 我需要你的帮助 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I need your help, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 长官 这里没有什么古怪 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. Nothing weird down there, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.80,0:15:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}水槽堵住了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sink just backed up on its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.44,0:15:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, l'll take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.99,0:15:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.99,0:15:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我不挡着你干活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, okay. l'll get out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.26,0:17:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和约翰·温彻斯特以前一起拥有这个车厂？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you and John Winchester, you used to own this garage together?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.35,0:17:11.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 好久前的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we used to. A long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.13,0:17:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}事实上约翰失踪大概20年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matter of fact, it must be 20 years since John disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.31,0:17:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么现在警察突然对这很感兴趣？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why are the cops interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.25,0:17:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们在重新调查一些未解决的案子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're reopening some unsolved cases.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.31,0:17:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其中一个案子就是温彻斯特失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Winchester disappearance is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.37,0:17:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 你想知道关于约翰的什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}ell, what do you wanna know? Whatever you remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你记得的全部 全都告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever sticks out in your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.65,0:17:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他相当顽固 我还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a stubborn bastard, I remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.34,0:17:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论做什么他都想赢 你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And whatever the game, he hated to lose, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退役的军官的习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the whole Marine thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:43.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但 他深爱着玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he sure loved Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.91,0:17:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对他的孩子们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he doted on those kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.00,0:17:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可这是大火以前的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that was before the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的。-\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他有没有说过那场大火？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ever talk about that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.36,0:17:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 刚开始一点也不提\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得那时他太悲痛了\N{\fnArial\fs30}think he was in shock. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.56,0:17:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 但后来他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But eventually?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.96,0:18:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说了些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did he say about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他开始有些古怪的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wasn't thinking straight. He said…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.95,0:18:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说有东西杀了玛丽放了那场大火\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said something caused that fire and killed Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说过是谁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He ever say what did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.05,0:18:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.21,0:18:13.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那只是场事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.99,0:18:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天花板或墙里的电线短路或什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}An electrical short in the ceiling or walls or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫他去见见心理医生 但\N{\fnArial\fs30}l begged him to get some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}t… But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.98,0:18:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情况越来越糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just got worse and worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.99,0:18:31.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么啦？他开始阅读那些奇怪的古书\N{\fnArial\fs30}ow? Oh, he started reading these strange old books.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.55,0:18:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且开始去见镇上那个看掌相的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He started going to see this palm reader in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看掌相的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Palm-reader?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.06,0:18:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.08,0:18:45.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}镇上还真有些通灵师和看掌相的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there are a few psychics and palm-readers in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人叫做艾德唯罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone named El Divino.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.15,0:18:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有神秘的佛特斯基先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the mysterious Mr. Fortensky.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}密苏里·莫斯利 还有些家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Issouri Mosley. Some dude named.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.70,0:18:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}密苏里·莫斯利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missouri Mosley?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:18:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.87,0:18:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是通灵师吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a psychic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.57,0:19:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 我想是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在爸爸的日记里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.08,0:19:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一页 第一句话 读读看\N{\fnArial\fs30}First page, first sentence. Read that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我去密苏里那里」 「知道了真相」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I went to Missouri and I learned the truth."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.28,0:19:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原来还以为他是去了密苏里州\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always thought he meant the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.78,0:19:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你别担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.39,0:19:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你老婆对你很在乎的 - 好的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your wife is crazy about you. - Well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.93,0:19:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可怜的家伙 他老婆和园丁有一腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}r bastard. His woman is cold banging the gardener.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.68,0:19:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不告诉他呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.76,0:19:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们来这不是为了真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}People don't come here for the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.66,0:19:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是来听好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}They come for good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.13,0:19:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆和迪恩 来吧 我今天可没什么时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Sam and Dean, come on already. I aingt got all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.50,0:20:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小家伙现在都是大帅哥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys grew up handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.03,0:20:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你那时候看起来真笨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were one goofy-looking kid too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.03,0:20:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你女朋友的事我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about your girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.26,0:20:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.55,0:20:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他失踪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.03,0:20:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know all that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们刚才就在想这些 就在刚才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… You were just thinking it, just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.87,0:20:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在那里？他还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he? Is he okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.33,0:20:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.42,0:20:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你是大师 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be a psychic, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.85,0:20:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子 你看到我拿骨头发功？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you see me sawing some bony tramp in half?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.70,0:20:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我是巫婆吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm a magician?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.76,0:20:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也许能读出人的想法感觉某些灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may read thoughts and sense energies in a room…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.92,0:21:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我不能无中生有\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't just pull facts out of thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.73,0:21:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.40,0:21:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你敢把臭脚摆在咖啡桌上的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put your foot on my coffee table,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.00,0:21:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定用勺子狠狠的扁你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna whack you with a spoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我什么也没做啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}l didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.88,0:21:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可你刚才想那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So our dad, when did you first meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.21,0:21:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么时候你第一次见他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came for a reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.14,0:21:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那场大火后 过了些日子他过来看书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few days after the fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.95,0:21:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是告诉他 那东西的确来自黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just told him what was really out there in the dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想你们会觉得是我把他带上这条猎魔之路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you could say I drew back the curtains for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.69,0:21:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那火呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道是什么杀了我们的妈妈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know about what killed our mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.04,0:21:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.76,0:21:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爸爸和我说起过那房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your daddy took me to your house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.09,0:22:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他希望我能去感应一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was hoping I could sense the echoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.52,0:22:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那东西的手印\N{\fnArial\fs30}the fingerprints of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.96,0:22:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你做到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.57,0:22:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.17,0:22:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.64,0:22:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.17,0:22:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哦…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.48,0:22:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那一定是魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.96,0:22:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对于那个人的手 我也很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}uice. Juice. Juice. I feel awful about the poor man's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.98,0:22:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我为什么要负责任？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, but how can I be held liable?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我请不起律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but I can't afford a lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.30,0:22:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 听着 我等会打回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, listen. You just gotta let me call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.41,0:22:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里奇 妈妈等会就回来 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, Mommy's gonna be right back, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.26,0:22:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}kay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.44,0:22:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们认为有东西回到了那房子里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think something's back in that house?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.62,0:22:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.17,0:22:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.63,0:22:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.39,0:23:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是没回去过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't been back inside…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.44,0:23:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我对那里很注意 它很安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}but l've been keeping an eye on the place, and it's been quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.50,0:23:11.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有突然死亡 古怪的事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sudden deaths, no freak accidents.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.10,0:23:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it acting up now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.80,0:23:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但爸爸失踪了 杰西卡也死了 这房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Dad going missing and Jessica dying and now this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.22,0:23:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都一起发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}all happening at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.58,0:23:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感觉像有事又开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it feels like something starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那可真让我鼓舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a comforting thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.55,0:23:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.47,0:24:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子 你老妈都快抓狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, baby, either we have rats or Mommy is going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.94,0:24:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.47,0:24:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.77,0:24:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子 你在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.15,0:24:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 妈妈 - 哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mama. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.30,0:25:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.02,0:25:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们来这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.81,0:25:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 詹妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.26,0:25:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我们的朋友密苏里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our friend, Missouri.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.47,0:25:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不打搅的话 我想带她看看房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were hoping to show her the old house. You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.81,0:25:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想看看过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}for old times' sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.50,0:25:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}.You know what? This isn't a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.93,0:25:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有点忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.67,0:25:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 詹妮 这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enny, it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.09,0:25:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给这女孩一点空间 你没看到她很不安吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give the poor girl a break. Can't you see she's upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.89,0:25:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原谅这个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.64,0:25:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他没恶意 他只是和人打交道脑子不好用\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means well. He's just not the sharpest tool in the shed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.35,0:25:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.98,0:25:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 关于什么？- 这房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About what? - About this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.14,0:25:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.10,0:25:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.60,0:25:44.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得这房子里有东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think there's something in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.95,0:25:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它想伤害你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that wants to hurt your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.56,0:25:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说错了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I mistaken?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.54,0:25:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.57,0:25:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们是能帮忙的人 能阻止这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're people who can help. Who can stop this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.96,0:25:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但你得信任我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna have to trust us just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.40,0:26:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果这里有黑暗的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there's a dark energy around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.30,0:26:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么这个房间就是这力量的中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}this room should be the center of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.94,0:26:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.43,0:26:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你的婴儿房 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This used to be your nursery, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.98,0:26:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是所有一切发生的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where it all happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.67,0:26:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}电磁辐射器？「感应鬼魂的设备」\N{\fnArial\fs30}That an EMF?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.76,0:26:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.34,0:26:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}业余的人用的玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.43,0:26:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道这是否让你们失望或松了口气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if you should be disappointed or relieved…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.59,0:26:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是杀害你妈妈的那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this aingt the thing that took your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.35,0:26:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.68,0:26:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.78,0:26:58.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我以前来这感觉到的力量不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't the same energy I felt the last time I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.44,0:26:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something different.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.04,0:27:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.11,0:27:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not it. Them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.23,0:27:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是它们 这里不只一个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more than one spirit in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.42,0:27:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们在这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.83,0:27:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们因为你们的家人而聚集\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here because of what happened to your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.36,0:27:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些年来 鬼怪不停的在你身边出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, all those years ago, real evil came to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.30,0:27:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它靠近这个房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It walked this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.05,0:27:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个魔鬼受了伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kind of evil leaves wounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.09,0:27:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伤口还感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes wounds get infected.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.03,0:27:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.66,0:27:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这地方对于超自然力量就像是「磁体」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is a magnet for paranormal energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.03,0:27:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它吸引了一个恶鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's attracted a poltergeist.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.80,0:27:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个很邪恶的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nasty one.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.30,0:27:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹妮和她的孩子没死 它不会罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it won't rest until Jenny and her babies are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.74,0:27:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说这里不止一个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said there was more than one spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.27,0:27:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是不太确定另一个是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just can't quite make out the second one.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.02,0:28:03.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 至少能确定一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, one thing's for damn sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.51,0:28:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不会让别人再死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's dying in this house ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.33,0:28:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以无论它是什么 我们怎么阻止它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever is here, how do we stop it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.00,0:28:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些材料是什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what is all this stuff, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.52,0:28:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当归根 大篷车的油 十字路口的尘土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angelica Root, Van Van oil, crossroad dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.35,0:28:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有些其它材料\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few other odds and ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.71,0:28:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们用这些干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we supposed to do with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.23,0:28:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们会在这房子的每层楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna put them inside the walls…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.20,0:28:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的东南西北的墙里 放进这些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the north, south, east, west corners on each floor of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.61,0:28:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在墙上打洞 詹妮会「喜欢」我们这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna be punching holes in the drywall, Jenny's gonna love that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.99,0:28:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可她会活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll live.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.49,0:28:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这会摧毁那个鬼魂吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}nd this will destroy the spirits? lt should.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.47,0:28:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然 这房子从此就干净了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should purify the house completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.28,0:28:47.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们每人挑一层 但手脚得快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}'ll each take a floor. But we work fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.25,0:28:54.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦鬼魂意识到我们在做什么 那时候就不太妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the spirits realize what we're up to things are gonna get bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.89,0:28:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.86,0:28:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.68,0:29:05.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 把你们留在这里我不太放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, l'm not sure I'm comfortable leaving you guys here alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.32,0:29:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带你的孩子去看电影或做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your kids to the movie or something…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.80,0:29:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当你回来的时候什么都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it will be over by the time you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.07,0:29:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.06,0:30:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.37,0:30:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.02,0:31:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定这都结束了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is over?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.82,0:31:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.83,0:31:46.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.60,0:31:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么你这么问？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.16,0:31:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.38,0:31:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该结束了 我也觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.47,0:31:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.07,0:31:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.53,0:32:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.37,0:32:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 对不起 我们会赔偿这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Sorry. We'll pay for all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.93,0:32:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.30,0:32:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩会收拾残局的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's gonna clean up this mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.35,0:32:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还傻在这干吗 孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what are you waiting for, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.16,0:32:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拿着抹布 别在心里咒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}t the mop. And don't cuss at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.13,0:32:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.46,0:33:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我 我们还在这里干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are we still doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.64,0:33:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道 我 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}l don't know. I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.80,0:33:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是有不好的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}l still have a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.21,0:33:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？密苏里 已经把问题解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Missouri did her Zelda Rubinstein thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.21,0:33:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这房子干净了 这该结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.10,0:33:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 应该这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.81,0:33:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我只是还想确认一下 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I just wanna make sure, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.10,0:33:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我现在只想上床睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, problem is, I could be sleeping in a bed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.82,0:34:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean. Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.32,0:34:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去救孩子 我去救詹妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You grab the kids, I'll get Jenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.67,0:34:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.68,0:34:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}詹妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}me on! Jenny!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.47,0:34:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我开不了门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}l can't open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.48,0:34:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.18,0:34:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.91,0:34:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, my kids!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.69,0:34:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆去救你孩子了 快跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}m's got your kids. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.36,0:34:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.86,0:34:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.90,0:34:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来这 别看它 别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. Come here. Don't look. Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.75,0:35:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎丽 带你弟弟快离开这里 别回头看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sari, take your brother outside as fast as you can. Don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.39,0:35:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没事吧 孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.51,0:35:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}莎丽 萨姆在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sari, where's Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.89,0:35:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在里面 有东西抓住了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's inside. Something has got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.48,0:35:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.40,0:36:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.87,0:36:32.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}sam? Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.75,0:36:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不要 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.92,0:36:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么？为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.17,0:36:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我知道她是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I know who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.74,0:36:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在看到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.38,0:37:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.16,0:37:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.73,0:37:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.57,0:37:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.13,0:37:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.97,0:38:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 滚出我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get out of my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.80,0:38:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放过我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let go of my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.27,0:38:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.16,0:38:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.41,0:38:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for these.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.21,0:38:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别谢谢我 本来就是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't thank me. They're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.09,0:39:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里再也没鬼魂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there are no spirits in there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.06,0:39:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这次确定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.20,0:39:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我妈妈也不在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even my mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.52,0:39:06.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.19,0:39:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}发生了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.64,0:39:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你妈妈的灵魂和那个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom's spirit and the poltergeist's energy…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.27,0:39:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}它们互相抵消了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they canceled each other out.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.83,0:39:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你妈妈用自己摧毁了那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom destroyed herself going after the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.72,0:39:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她为什么要那么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she do something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.97,0:39:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然是为了保护她的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to protect her boys, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.97,0:39:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 我很难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, l'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.47,0:39:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.20,0:39:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你感觉到了你妈妈 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sensed it was here, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.99,0:39:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而我却不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even when I couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.88,0:39:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.47,0:40:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我该有答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I should have all the answers…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.32,0:40:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.27,0:40:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.76,0:40:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye. - Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.52,0:40:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.61,0:40:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以后别当我是陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you boys be strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.46,0:40:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.09,0:40:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.81,0:40:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.24,0:41:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他拥有那么强大的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he has such powerful abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.82,0:41:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可他却为什么不能感觉到自己的爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why he couldn't sense his own father.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.70,0:41:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.08,0:41:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary's spirit?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.05,0:41:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真的觉得是她救了孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think she saved the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.87,0:41:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.80,0:41:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰·温彻斯特 我真想扁你一顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Winchester, I could just slap you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.63,0:41:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么不去和你孩子见面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go talk to your children?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.65,0:41:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天啊 我也想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.19,0:41:53.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不知道我有多想见他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea how much I wanna see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.57,0:42:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我不能 现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I can't. Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.40,0:42:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}直到我发现真相时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until I know the truth.
